<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Wednesday, Oct 2 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt)</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Wednesday    Oct	  2   $63.79    dn 0.15</p>
<p>Tuesday	Oct	  1   $63.94    up 0.15</p>
